## 4. Typography
- Families: heading **Inter**, body **Inter**, mono **JetBrains Mono**.
- Base 16px, ratio ×1.333. Scale: xs 9px · sm 12px · md 16px · lg 21px · xl 28px · 2xl 38px · 3xl 51px · 4xl 67px.

| Style | Size | Weight | Line height | Family |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| display | 67px | 700 | 1.2 | Inter |
| heading.xl | 51px | 700 | 1.2 | Inter |
| heading.lg | 38px | 600 | 1.2 | Inter |
| heading.md | 28px | 600 | 1.35 | Inter |
| heading.sm | 21px | 600 | 1.35 | Inter |
| body.lg | 21px | 400 | 1.65 | Inter |
| body.md | 16px | 400 | 1.5 | Inter |
| body.sm | 12px | 400 | 1.5 | Inter |
| label.md | 12px | 500 | 1.35 | Inter |
| caption | 9px | 400 | 1.5 | Inter |
| code | 12px | 400 | 1.5 | JetBrains Mono |

## 5. Spacing
- 8px grid. Scale: space.0=0px, space.1=8px, space.2=16px, space.3=24px, space.4=32px, space.5=40px, space.6=48px, space.8=64px, space.10=80px, space.12=96px, space.16=128px, space.20=160px, space.24=192px, space.0-5=4px, space.1-5=12px.
- Component insets: sm 16px · md 24px · lg 32px (`--space-inset-md`).
- Do not use values outside this scale.

## 6. Radius
- none: 0px (`--radius-none`)
- sm: 8px (`--radius-sm`)
- md: 12px (`--radius-md`)
- lg: 16px (`--radius-lg`)
- xl: 24px (`--radius-xl`)
- full: 9999px (`--radius-full`)
- Controls use `md`; cards and dialogs use `lg`; pills/avatars use `full`.

## 7. Elevation
- sm: `0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)`
- md: `0 4px 8px -2px rgba(16,24,40,0.10), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)`
- lg: `0 12px 24px -6px rgba(16,24,40,0.14), 0 4px 8px -4px rgba(16,24,40,0.08)`
- xl: `0 24px 48px -12px rgba(16,24,40,0.24)`
- Cards: `sm`/`md`. Popovers/menus: `lg`. Modals: `xl`. Prefer borders over shadows for flat surfaces.

## 8. Interaction states
| State | Rule |
|---|---|
| Hover | primary → `--color-action-primary-hover` |
| Active | primary → `--color-action-primary-active` |
| Focus-visible | 2px outline `--color-border-focus`, 2px offset; never remove |
| Disabled | `--color-action-primary-disabled` background, `--color-text-disabled` text, no pointer events |
| Loading | keep width, show spinner, set `aria-busy` |
| Motion | 150/300/500ms; honor `prefers-reduced-motion` |

## 9. Component conventions
- **Button:** height 44px (sm 36, lg 52), radius md, one primary per view; variants: primary, secondary, ghost, destructive.
- **Input / Select:** height 44px, border `--color-border-strong`, label above, helper and error text below; error uses `--color-feedback-danger-fg` plus an icon (not color alone).
- **Card:** `--color-bg-secondary` surface, 1px `--color-border-default`, radius lg, inset md.
- **Table:** header `--color-bg-tertiary`, row dividers `--color-border-default`, numeric columns right-aligned.
- **Badge:** feedback bg/fg tokens, radius full, never the only status indicator.
- **Alert:** feedback bg/border/fg tokens, icon + text, `role="status"` or `role="alert"`.
- Prefer composition over adding variants; a variant must carry real behavior or meaning.

## 10. Accessibility rules
- Baseline: **WCAG 2.2 AA**: text 4.5:1 (large 3:1), UI components and focus 3:1.
- Touch targets ≥ 44×44px on mobile (current controls: 44px).
- Full keyboard operability and visible focus. Every control has an accessible name.
- Never convey meaning by color alone. Respect reduced motion.
- Body text ≥ 16px.

## 11. Naming conventions
- JSON tokens: dot (`color.action.primary.default`). CSS: `--color-action-primary-default`. Figma: `color/action/primary/default`.
- Props camelCase; icons kebab-case.

## 12. Implementation guidance
- Tokens: `design-tokens.json` (source) and `tokens.css` (variables). Import `tokens.css` once at the app root; set `data-theme="dark"` on the root for dark mode.
- Never hard-code colors, spacing, radius, font sizes or shadows. Use `var(--color-text-primary)` etc.
- Search existing components before creating new ones. Compose; do not copy and tweak.
- When unsure, pick the closest existing token and leave a `TODO(design-system)` comment.
